  "gameDescriptionHtml": "\n<b>True crime has never felt more real.</b><p></p>\n<p>The 2024 true-crime podcast “My Escape from the Slackjaw Killer” took America by storm—with its unflinching interview of his only known surviving victim. Painstakingly recreated from testimony, crime scene photos, and FBI reports, this game puts you in Slackjaw’s world and asks: Will you survive?</p>\n<p>EXPLORE – Explore the world of a serial killer as his next victim.<br>\nSOLVE – Use your wits and resources to solve puzzles.<br>\nUNCOVER – Uncover the twisted secrets buried deep within his basement.<br>\nESCAPE – Escape to survive. But be quiet, he’s upstairs….</p>\n<p><b>Game Features</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Escape room gameplay.\n</li><li>Hyper-realistic graphics powered by Unreal Engine 5.\n</li><li>Haunting original soundtrack.\n</li><li>Xbox controller support.\n</li><li>Complete in a single play session.\n</li><li>Created by a solo developer.\n</li></ul>\n",
